 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "She Is My Mother In Law But I Dont Want Any Conflicts Between us"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "시어머니지만 고부 갈등은 싫습니다"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "After her husband's sudden death, she became a widow and the head of a noble family. Her stepson, cheerful and supportive, takes her side, while her older daughter-in-law, who dislikes her, warns, \"Please maintain proper decorum.\" Amidst this brewing mother-in-law vs. daughter-in-law drama, she uses her past life experience as a tutor to open a counseling service for troubled souls. A modern-day noble family conflict with a twist: free counseling sessions! (No appearance fees.)"
  },
